{"id":"03d29933105b3e86","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Radical Ideal","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal — ZFC Algebra2 Radical Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal — ZFC Algebra2 Radical Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ring]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal — ZFC Algebra2 Radical Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,0,1,I,J,p,h\\in V\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,0,1,I,J,p,h\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J \\subseteq R\">\\(J \\subseteq R\\)</span> (radical of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\">\\(\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\\)</span> (ring-ideal predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\\)</span> (finite-power relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2RadicalIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2RadicalIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq R\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(+\\!(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\exists b\\in I\\;(+\\!(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=0)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(\\cdot\\!(\\langle r,a\\rangle)\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq R\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(+\\!(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\exists b\\in I\\;(+\\!(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=0)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(\\cdot\\!(\\langle r,a\\rangle)\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}ring\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\\leftrightarrow r,p\\in R\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(h,n+1,R)\\land h(0)=1\\land h(n)=p\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(h(i+1)=\\cdot\\!(\\langle h(i),r\\rangle))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}ring\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\\leftrightarrow r,p\\in R\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(h,n+1,R)\\land h(0)=1\\land h(n)=p\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(h(i+1)=\\cdot\\!(\\langle h(i),r\\rangle))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}radical\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2RadicalIdeal}_S(J,I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\\land J=\\{r\\in R:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists p\\in I\\;\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}radical\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2RadicalIdeal}_S(J,I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\\land J=\\{r\\in R:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists p\\in I\\;\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set-ideal predicate formerly linked here concerns downward-closed families of sets and is not a ring ideal; the ring-ideal closure laws are stated locally.</li>\n<li>Ring powers are witnessed by a finite recursion using the declared multiplication graph, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r^n\">\\(r^n\\)</span> is not an unsourced overloaded operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)$ (see [[58-df-ring]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,0,1,I,J,p,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"J \\subseteq R","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2RadicalIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq R\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(+\\!(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in I)\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\exists b\\in I\\;(+\\!(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=0)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(\\cdot\\!(\\langle r,a\\rangle)\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}ring\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\\leftrightarrow r,p\\in R\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(h,n+1,R)\\land h(0)=1\\land h(n)=p\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(h(i+1)=\\cdot\\!(\\langle h(i),r\\rangle))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}radical\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2RadicalIdeal}_S(J,I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0)\\land J=\\{r\\in R:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists p\\in I\\;\\mathrm{RingPower}_S(p,r,n;R,\\cdot,1)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"r^n","display":false}],"bytes":2060,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1430","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-radical-ideal]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1c30d21ea7b443f6","36d7463d215be751"]}